<contentList>
<content contentuid="hfee86ed4g0537g4aecg9f15gb7f03e53b7ac" version="1">Stigma</content>
<content contentuid="h1f7cdec7g145eg4e03g9b5dgbd3b94a17d33" version="1">Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="hf276f7c3g35f1g4529gbed8g23bad5823075" version="1">Stigma of Communion</content>
<content contentuid="ha88bfc36gb669g403fg9722g5c56ef0c8bd5" version="1">Gains &lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;Temporary Hit Points&lt;/LSTag&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each combat&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="h0dbd5b46g768eg4a48gbc28g9d039588d51d" version="1">Stigma of Anchoring</content>
<content contentuid="he27f4f01g134fg4511ga3a5g7641a778a843" version="1">Cannot be moved against its will.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="hf978dd37g285bg4363ga1ccg4b710f257836" version="1">Stigma of Sealing</content>
<content contentuid="hcb8a6c1cg9bf1g4123g9254g8c889b6b0780" version="1">&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to all spell damage. Spell attackers lose &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Concentration"&gt;Concentration&lt;/LSTag&gt; on hit.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="h6723d47eg8406g42f8ga152gd2062bfe4fe5" version="1">Stigma of Temperance</content>
<content contentuid="h73e31ca9g5287g4082ga79eg818df753b75e" version="1">Cannot be &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;Frightened&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED"&gt;Charmed&lt;/LSTag&gt; or &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLEEP"&gt;put to Sleep&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="ha006f772g45beg4be0gbe6dg624ea8eca2a3" version="1">Stigma of Preaching</content>
<content contentuid="h287be20bgedb9g436dga58dga2986567ca16" version="1">Rerolls an &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;attack roll&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;once per attack&lt;/b&gt; when the result is below &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="hcaa962d3g8d49g4f4cg88deg617305a137a6" version="1">Stigma of the Thread</content>
<content contentuid="h1a29a71eg57e8g455dg9538g9938a3af856c" version="1">Gains an &lt;b&gt;additional&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;Bonus Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="h8ec7b9f4gd0ffg4d0fg9ddeg7cd5b582e86a" version="1">Stigma of the Prophet</content>
<content contentuid="h7733e85cg431fg4c0bga99cg5a77e8ef66c2" version="1">A chance to gain &lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="Inspiration"/&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Inspiration"&gt;Inspiration&lt;/LSTag&gt; when afflicted with &lt;b&gt;any condition&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="hf300bbacgdf22g4e15g95ffg47c19fa9e17f" version="1">Stigma of Pain</content>
<content contentuid="h69e827a2g883bg4f1aga257g132c233e6160" version="1">Attackers take&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; and begin to &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleed&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
<content contentuid="hac5a30dbgdabag483bgb7f5ge056bcbfae6b" version="1">Stigma of the Bone</content>
<content contentuid="h17eba199g2448g4967gb756gf77b9f017462" version="1">&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to physical damage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/LSTag&gt; to all other damage.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="hb4c66339g7bd6g4780g84b4gb1b507bbb913" version="1">Stigma of Martyrdom</content>
<content contentuid="h5de54cc6gcbc1g465dgb655g80b547f166cf" version="1">Cannot be &lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;critically hit&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Rises after death at &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;Action Surge&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeds&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt; and when the Stigma is applied.</content>
<content contentuid="h2202817cg14afg4411gabfbg1ed16011f20c" version="1">Stigma: Last Breath</content>
<content contentuid="h76dc967cgb340g4594gb706g84ced26870ed" version="1">Rises with &lt;b&gt;half maximum&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt; and a surge of &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACTION_SURGE"&gt;action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
<content contentuid="h930158d8gd417g4acfg8758gf632f35ca50a" version="1">Veil</content>
<content contentuid="hd9c269f9g0a25g4434g94e4geef8b343be80" version="1">Wrapped in divine stillness. Cannot be harmed by anything.</content>
<content contentuid="he4674180gb494g4048g9359g8fb0104fa720" version="1">Mysteries of Suffering</content>
<content contentuid="h0fcf3abdgfcc0g40efg8f61gbc7eab47fa16" version="2">Only the artefact's &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="AMP_Ilmater_Prayer_Communion_1"&gt;Prayer&lt;/LSTag&gt; requires walking the &lt;b&gt;path of Ilmater&lt;/b&gt; as an acolyte of the Crying God. The artefact's other gifts serve all who wear it.</content>


<content contentuid="he7316dc0g1bcag6fa6g7cc8g829c3e9c330c" version="1">The Chosen One's Palms</content>
<content contentuid="heda7c079g2156g0b2ag7498g7711271b170e" version="1">The one who did not choose the chosen one would not be who he is if he had not chosen the one he did not choose, having had the desire to choose, but instead of becoming who he did not want to be, he ended up becoming the one he had chosen himself.</content>

<content contentuid="hd2a09feege148g4cfbg93a2g8a135ebb55c8" version="1">Prayer of Communion</content>
<content contentuid="hc57b7667gd054g4c8bg9c73g4bef4b67852b" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_AMULET"&gt;Stigma of Communion&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - at the &lt;b&gt;start of each combat&lt;/b&gt; they gain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;Temporary Hit Points&lt;/LSTag&gt;. If already under a Stigma - &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time. Cannot target self.</content>

<content contentuid="h64608e9agf5d8g4d15g88e2gcc2dc1c053ce" version="1">Anointing</content>
<content contentuid="hdab8b19eg861eg4a47ga33bg8a97e71be29f" version="1">When you heal an ally carrying any &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_AMULET"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; below &lt;b&gt;half&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;hit points&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you &lt;b&gt;once per turn&lt;/b&gt; pour an &lt;b&gt;additional&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; into them.</content>

<content contentuid="h704f0951gb2dag4a44g80d1gb0e426c169d6" version="1">Transference</content>
<content contentuid="hca3f058fg51c6g48d5g9016ge5b0d9346fdf" version="1">When you cast a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_AMULET"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt;, they regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h58c4c24agb583g3618g0fbdgb9cdf704c60f" version="1">Ring of the Red Window</content>
<content contentuid="h370c3af5g269fgdbf0g9ca5g94f8152f8a7b" version="1">Forged from a shackle link, set with red glass - the window his djinn master watched executions through. Adan gave it to the priest and left the same day.</content>

<content contentuid="h1be40b5eg9920g48d9g8d67g9be62215e4ea" version="1">Prayer of Anchoring</content>
<content contentuid="h4fc474e9g9706g4be1gaf96g5fff6f77c1c2" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_RING"&gt;Stigma of Anchoring&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - they cannot be moved against their will. If already under a Stigma - &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time. Cannot target self.</content>

<content contentuid="h5dce7526g7620g44e2ga4aag85840ae4c10f" version="1">Watchful Eye</content>
<content contentuid="h169d6248gd129g45ccg90begf0901c22ce37" version="1">Foes within &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; of an ally carrying any &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_RING"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; have &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;Disadvantage&lt;/LSTag&gt; on &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRolls"&gt;Attack Rolls&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hef68ab12g48b8g48f3gaab4g34e92d95bd69" version="1">Flare</content>
<content contentuid="h032d0083g0b9dg41aag93c2geb8799985b1d" version="1">When you cast a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_RING"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt;, a burst of searing light deals &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; to foes within &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; of them.</content>

<content contentuid="h9039e46ag0117gfa5dgcc3fg807d0ba66ce2" version="1">Diadem of the Nameless</content>
<content contentuid="h4ab86b63g7f2eg6bfag103eg5c22e9593aa9" version="1">Recovered in Tethyr with the body of a woman in a burned-out cellar. The house burned whole, except for a circle around her.</content>

<content contentuid="h0485d806ga62ag4383g8adag4a3e16100b68" version="1">Prayer of Sealing</content>
<content contentuid="h6563f422gbbbag45a5gbaa6gc2c072937855" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_DIADEM"&gt;Stigma of Sealing&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - they gain &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;resistance&lt;/LSTag&gt; to all spell damage and break &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Concentration"&gt;Concentration&lt;/LSTag&gt; of spell attackers. If already under a Stigma - &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time. Cannot target self.</content>

<content contentuid="hf014f324g802eg48adgb67ag8a0718ce6527" version="1">Providence</content>
<content contentuid="h01e2ea8bg21a0g45e0g80bfg6fe71f4a599c" version="1">A wounded ally carrying any of your Stigmas regains &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="he1620065g2489g437fg8ed2g8feddadbaa4f" version="1">Radiance</content>
<content contentuid="h51fb3e6ag3d89g40f3gbc91g084b57ae8117" version="1">When you heal an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_DIADEM"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt;, foes within &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; of them gain &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_RADIANT_RADIATING_ORB"&gt;Radiating Orb&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>

<content contentuid="h2c9ba5c8gd3eag4439ga279gcef4135ab295" version="1">Retribution</content>
<content contentuid="h87807a1dg751cg4d15gb050g25798e6739cd" version="1">When an ally carrying any of your Stigmas takes &lt;b&gt;melee damage&lt;/b&gt; from a foe, they unleash a &lt;b&gt;free&lt;/b&gt; Level &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Smite_Divine_3"&gt;Divine Smite&lt;/LSTag&gt; in response.</content>

<content contentuid="hbd5d2129g1c05g7cd0gd882g9789edc8ad2f" version="1">Robe of the Yellow Rose</content>
<content contentuid="h5f0ec69bg2ef5g2febgb150g0fd15b02bf4e" version="1">Sewn at Yellow Rose for a fisherman's son who never came. His daughter took it, forty-seven years later.</content>

<content contentuid="h3291b2c1g47fag4d8dga3b9g7738a5e930ae" version="1">Prayer of Temperance</content>
<content contentuid="h588067c8g59c6g4888gbf93gf5b827b293e3" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_ROBE"&gt;Stigma of Temperance&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - they cannot be &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;Frightened&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED"&gt;Charmed&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLEEP"&gt;put to Sleep&lt;/LSTag&gt; or &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STUNNED"&gt;Stunned&lt;/LSTag&gt;. If already under a Stigma - &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time. Cannot target self.</content>

<content contentuid="he3750c21gd324g4c0cga6c3g15a91a71c751" version="1">Aegis</content>
<content contentuid="ha91b3e72gc922g4e7eg8f3bg902b8cba92c9" version="1">When you heal an ally with a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you &lt;b&gt;once per turn&lt;/b&gt; grant them &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;Temporary Hit Points&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h4e3901a9gf73eg43fag8269gb01aba1d5ad9" version="1">Overflow</content>
<content contentuid="hc8979171ga0dbg4b49g93e1ge646b1615bc7" version="1">When you heal an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_ROBE"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; with a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt;, foes within &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; of them &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>

<content contentuid="hd8073a1dg8b45g4d94gb0fbgab9aa6b5b975" version="1">Overshadowing</content>
<content contentuid="h94077583g9095g4e2dg9155g11de53c2fe8f" version="1">The &lt;b&gt;first time&lt;/b&gt; you are afflicted with &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;Bleeding&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt;, you are wrapped in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_VEIL"&gt;Veil&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turn or until &lt;b&gt;your first attack&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hd13ebccega74bgeff0g01b8gb317a0c88fd9" version="1">Cloak of the Sixth Pit</content>
<content contentuid="h1854b41fg6ad5g279bg706bgf9e386d5182d" version="1">One shroud for twenty bodies, during the Rotten Spring below Suzail. The earth soaked through. The cloth did not.</content>

<content contentuid="hfbb763e7g28ebg4567ga43egd4f691356c44" version="1">Prayer of Preaching</content>
<content contentuid="h5ab9ffcagb507g4b24ga0ebg8344f796ee0b" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_CLOAK"&gt;Stigma of Preaching&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - &lt;b&gt;once per attack&lt;/b&gt;, they reroll an &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;attack roll&lt;/LSTag&gt; below &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; May be placed on &lt;b&gt;any&lt;/b&gt; number of allies.</content>

<content contentuid="h37440c03gd8d0g427bgb367gbe00cda68072" version="1">Echo of the Litany</content>
<content contentuid="hcaec3c13gce0fg423dgb3c8ga84078063f09" version="1">When you heal an ally under any &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_CLOAK"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; with a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt;, every &lt;b&gt;other creature&lt;/b&gt; under your Stigmas regains &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h8c0bb278g5366g477egb282g74fb81cd196a" version="1">Unbroken</content>
<content contentuid="h02a45500gcb81g412bgb482gaa1a44e98675" version="1">If you have &lt;b&gt;already placed&lt;/b&gt; a Stigma this combat, &lt;b&gt;one Ilmater prayer per turn&lt;/b&gt; costs no &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="he4e08600g2807g4870gd4c6g0c89493a3ef8" version="1">The Stayed Hands</content>
<content contentuid="hb06ac20cg96d2gc946gd74fg43f87abc6c6c" version="1">Thirty-two kills, all contact poisons. When the Amn poisoner went to cut off his own hands, the monks of Ilmater stopped him.</content>

<content contentuid="h6d417677g3000g442ag8bdbgd53711711f5e" version="1">Prayer of the Thread</content>
<content contentuid="hcabf8dadg427dg40ffga5f9g55c66edafeb3" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_GLOVES"&gt;Stigma of the Thread&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - they gain an &lt;b&gt;additional&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;Bonus Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; May be placed on &lt;b&gt;any&lt;/b&gt; number of allies.</content>

<content contentuid="h90f2e021g6cddg4457gbdaeg316c46a4b2f1" version="1">Right Hand</content>
<content contentuid="heaf12cd9gf119g4eb5g87bcg034ad71406c5" version="1">When you heal an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_GLOVES"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; with a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you restore one of their &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;Bonus Actions&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hf4ef1a67gf6ccg452fg960bgc253a717995a" version="1">Annunciation</content>
<content contentuid="hcec3e7b1g6332g4aa9gbbdege0e87f27b4b7" version="1">When you inflict &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Bless&lt;/LSTag&gt; on a creature, you &lt;b&gt;once per turn&lt;/b&gt; heal them for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h1d8b62bcg7030g4e62g95d6gc3a4a319fce6" version="1">Rapture</content>
<content contentuid="hd11a19b4g7beeg4befga2cagbac4c4ee9b50" version="1">After healing an ally with a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt;, you &lt;b&gt;once per turn&lt;/b&gt; may cast your next &lt;LSTag Tooltip="EvocationSpells"&gt;evocation&lt;/LSTag&gt; spell without spending an &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h552b8169g122dg51d8gd85egd03fe80deb62" version="1">Boots of the Trackless Vigil</content>
<content contentuid="h202a7048g97d1g6f8cgb86ag4c66a788555c" version="1">She walked the Sembian coast for twenty years and left no tracks. When they found her in the field, only the boots remained.</content>

<content contentuid="h3d3b9140gdb46g4568g9380g6fd6f0881a20" version="1">Prayer of the Prophet</content>
<content contentuid="h114f980cgf2bfg4421gba49g4b112de78434" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_BOOTS"&gt;Stigma of the Prophet&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally - when afflicted with &lt;b&gt;any condition&lt;/b&gt;, they have a chance to gain &lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="Inspiration"/&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Inspiration"&gt;Inspiration&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; May be placed on &lt;b&gt;any&lt;/b&gt; number of allies.</content>

<content contentuid="hac53b42bg2791g4d25gb833g1a10f224aa49" version="1">Quickening</content>
<content contentuid="ha0aa171agbfadg4883ga42dg233f2a618b26" version="1">The &lt;b&gt;first time&lt;/b&gt; you gain &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_MOMENTUM"&gt;Momentum&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in a combat&lt;/b&gt;, you regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; and start to &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>

<content contentuid="h4d3e8939g0b3dg42bbgad84g0b84a896afca" version="1">Edification</content>
<content contentuid="h0e7fb2a8g4ee4g43degaa93g128de55780bb" version="1">Whenever you afflict an ally carrying another &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_BOOTS"&gt;Stigma&lt;/LSTag&gt; with &lt;b&gt;any condition&lt;/b&gt;, they gain a &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; bonus to all &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SkillChecks"&gt;skill checks&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns. Duration stacks, up to &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
<content contentuid="h218de24fgc3d9g4a09g9f53g79897cbfc78f" version="1">Edification</content>
<content contentuid="he616a513g9adeg467cg9e54gebe5d50f7202" version="1">&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; bonus to all &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SkillChecks"&gt;skill checks&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h912aac1eg5535gdf13g67a4g4693e9e2c6ef" version="1">Helmet of the Third Day</content>
<content contentuid="h2155c844gd85ag5bceg0a3fg22c76f4ef261" version="1">Forged by the Loviatarans to mock a captive knight of Ilmater. On the third day, he began to pray inside it.</content>

<content contentuid="h3ef6da9ag196cg4155g8907gbee026700df2" version="1">Prayer of Pain</content>
<content contentuid="he089a645gd3ebg4816gbc50g41bd81236502" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_HELMET"&gt;Stigma of Pain&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally or yourself - attackers take &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; and start to &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns. If already under a Stigma - &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; turns instead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time.</content>

<content contentuid="ha881c3d1g5da2g4ebbg9cb6gd054bbdda871" version="1">Bloodflow</content>
<content contentuid="h3d6ff5d6g98beg4becga84dg2db1847bc06b" version="1">If you are &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleeding&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;b&gt;in combat&lt;/b&gt;, restore one Level &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="SpellSlot"&gt;spell slot&lt;/LSTag&gt; at the &lt;b&gt;start of each turn&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hcb7d57c2g7b3dg41fegb674gafabfcb5f9b5" version="1">Mortification of the Flesh</content>
<content contentuid="h4a0728e9g6c3fg485cga882g9da5aeab2c1b" version="1">You are &lt;b&gt;immune&lt;/b&gt; to&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h0734ab39ge5a3g4b5eg8bacgd20da9b30a8a" version="1">Investiture</content>
<content contentuid="h0e8d4807g3b7fg49cagac3cg0b6a6b8c5c69" version="1">When you deal&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; with a &lt;b&gt;melee weapon&lt;/b&gt;, you gain &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Bless&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns. If you already have Bless, a &lt;b&gt;[3]%&lt;/b&gt; chance to cloak yourself in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_VEIL"&gt;Veil&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>

<content contentuid="h85ee09degeacag2511g297bgdd95193ad5a6" version="1">Deserter's Armour</content>
<content contentuid="hde6af58eg4021g34c8g4965g9a1e9a43b92e" version="1">A former Zhentarim had it made after he stood guard at a burning hospice. Laced from the outside - one man can't remove it.</content>

<content contentuid="h0f8cea44g6fe9g4f64ga716g7133eb52c3eb" version="1">Prayer of the Bone</content>
<content contentuid="ha496bb24g01ccg420agbc0dgd6671695a37e" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_MEDIUMARMOR"&gt;Stigma of the Bone&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally or yourself - target becomes &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to physical damage, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;vulnerable&lt;/LSTag&gt; to all other damage, and all incoming damage is reduced by &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time.</content>

<content contentuid="h07bb763fg4990g4c52g9eadg06c9bc4e04eb" version="1">Recompense</content>
<content contentuid="h5896ff0dgdc69g4110gb701g947982bdee62" version="1">When you hit a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleeding&lt;/LSTag&gt; foe with a &lt;b&gt;melee weapon&lt;/b&gt;, you and &lt;b&gt;every ally&lt;/b&gt; under your Stigmas regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hbddd19c9ge026g4cebg88cbg1465d6430c39" version="1">Judgement</content>
<content contentuid="h942c86d9g6068g491eg9988g9b22697db9c7" version="1">&lt;b&gt;While&lt;/b&gt; you carry any Stigma, your &lt;b&gt;weapon attacks&lt;/b&gt; deal an &lt;b&gt;extra&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="h800134cag07b1g7fe6gb7b6g87740d0b10eb" version="1">Armour of the Noble Heart</content>
<content contentuid="hcb7afa37g46a3g4fa6g22cegbfda848aa03b" version="1">Among the Companions of the Noble Heart, a captain wears no new armour. His is assembled from the fragments of those he failed to protect.</content>

<content contentuid="h03b48f3dgfe1eg4730g9c4fgd78dd425ee4d" version="1">Prayer of Martyrdom</content>
<content contentuid="hca4d7e8age3edg4ea7ga954gbbd87e2de72e" version="1">Utter a secret prayer and place the &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_STIGMA_HEAVYARMOR"&gt;Stigma of Martyrdom&lt;/LSTag&gt; on an ally or yourself - they cannot be &lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;critically hit&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;b&gt;One&lt;/b&gt; such Stigma at a time.</content>

<content contentuid="h8cae410egba28g4c49gafecgb40188e96ee9" version="1">Intercession</content>
<content contentuid="he552a9c6ga7e3g469bg985eg3c11df493ed8" version="1">When you &lt;b&gt;slay a foe&lt;/b&gt;, you and &lt;b&gt;every ally&lt;/b&gt; under your Stigmas regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hd3116e7egbd96g4df9ga55fgf63cc147995b" version="1">Martyr's Pyre</content>
<content contentuid="h14c2c5e0ge6b9g4e47gad04g1fb9725932c6" version="1">&lt;b&gt;While&lt;/b&gt; you carry another Stigma, attackers start to &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;bleed&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;If they are &lt;b&gt;already bleeding&lt;/b&gt;, they are wreathed in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HOLY"&gt;Holy flames&lt;/LSTag&gt; instead.</content>

<content contentuid="h6f3bd143gb1d0g410cga5f8g398cedec2826" version="1">Smiting</content>
<content contentuid="hb064218fg734ag488egae8cg68a7904ca041" version="1">When you hit a foe wreathed in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BURNING_HOLY"&gt;Holy flames&lt;/LSTag&gt; with a &lt;b&gt;melee weapon&lt;/b&gt;, you unleash a &lt;b&gt;free&lt;/b&gt; Level &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Smite_Divine_4"&gt;Divine Smite&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hbf53c64ag4647g4c82g964bg577c2a79066f" version="1">Hosanna</content>
<content contentuid="ha82830a1g1e72g4a47g8cc1g8199e69a6e0c" version="1">Your next &lt;LSTag Tooltip="EvocationSpells"&gt;evocation&lt;/LSTag&gt; spell costs no &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

<content contentuid="hc1099961g837dg4f07g835dg29354c564e8e" version="1">Answered Prayer</content>
<content contentuid="h10827197g9b16g49efg80f0gb3659e7cf09e" version="1">Your next Ilmater prayer this turn costs no &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;Action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
<content contentuid="h9a5ffd91g5c96g4948g8a94g9518dde0e21c" version="1">Burden of the Crying God</content>
<content contentuid="hbc06e368gfcf0g4c3dgb446g382e14c92a57" version="1">You bear the suffering of those you have blessed with stigmata. While above &lt;b&gt;50% HP&lt;/b&gt;, you are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/LSTag&gt; to &lt;b&gt;all damage&lt;/b&gt;. Ilmater's grace flows through pain, not pride.</content>
